{"language":"en","values":[["/names/cn","莱卡"],["/names/en","Lyca"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名擅长破环敌人护甲的射手，并且可以提升友军输出能力。"],["/description_i18n/en","A Marksman who is skilled at lowering enemy's Phys DEF and imbuing buffs to allies."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","迷路了吗？请跟上我"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Are you lost? Follow me."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","星辰愈发闪耀了"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","The stars sparkle ever more brilliantly."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","星光啊，照耀吧"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Shine, stars."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","流星终将坠落……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","...The meteor... will eventually... fall..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","群星引导着胜利"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","The constellations guide us to victory."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","一起观赏星光吧"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/en","Let's enjoy the starlight together."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/cn","早上好。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","*Yawn* Oh! Good morning."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/cn","今天又要并肩作战了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Today, we fight together once more."],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/cn","痒吗？没事了。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","Ticklish? It's alright."],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/cn","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","你怎么知道我会喜欢这个？难道这是星辰的指引？！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/en","How did you know I'd like this? Were you guided by the stars?!"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","我没用过这种东西……如果有机会，我会试试的。谢谢你！"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/en","I've never had one of these. If given the chance, I'll make good use. Thank you!"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","驭星猎手"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/en","Keeper of Glades"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","弓弦指向的不仅是猎物，还有她注定要抵达的前方。"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/en","Her bow aims not only at prey, but toward the destiny waiting ahead."],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","深林春晓"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/en","Woodland Dawn"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","森林用繁花、新叶和一场春天为她送上新装。"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/en","The forest gifts her an outfit woven from flowers, fresh leaves, and spring itself."],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","绮梦寻珍活动剧情获得。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/en","Verdant Treasures Story"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","精英"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/en","Elite"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","难得休息一会儿……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I can finally get some rest..."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","喝完这杯就去巡逻吧"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/1/text_i18n/en","I'll start the patrol after finishing this."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有什么新口味？"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Any new flavors?"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","看，这是雪灯树"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/2/lines/0/text_i18n/en","Look, it's a Yuletide tree!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我准备了很多礼物！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/3/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I've prepared lots of gifts!"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","好漂亮的彩缎啊！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/4/lines/0/text_i18n/en","These satin ribbons are gorgeous."],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","我准备了很漂亮的灯！"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/5/lines/0/text_i18n/en","I've prepared the most splendid lights!"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林里几乎没有谁会讨厌莱卡，除了个别被她亲手拉弓对准的人。"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/en","It seems that nobody in the Dark Forest harbors any ill will towards Lyca, save for those who find themselves at the wrong end of her bow."],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","莱卡和谁都能成为朋友，连鸟兽都会主动亲近她，这常令同行的埃隆有些艳羡。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/en","Lyca can make friends with anyone, including the creatures of the forest. Eironn, her frequent travel companion, cannot help but feel somewhat jealous of this quality."],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","芙拉贝尔曾试图邀请莱卡共同编写一本教材：《说话的艺术》。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/en","Florabelle once invited Lyca to help her write a new textbook, \"The Art of Speech\"."],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","“莱卡队长一整天都愁眉不展，我猜昨夜的星象显示了不好的运势。”有人曾听到薄暮巡游队的队员这样说。"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/en","\"Captain Lyca has been looking gloomy all day. I'm guessing last night's star reading wasn't very good.\"—Overheard from one of the Dusk Patrollers."],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","“莱卡什么都好，就是对既定的命运太相信了，如果星象显示她做不成一件事，她就会放弃尝试。”——芙拉贝尔"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/en","\"Lyca's great at everything, but she places way too much faith in destiny. Whenever her star reading tells her she can't accomplish something, she just gives up.\"—Florabelle"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","莱卡知道自己所有队员喜欢的食物口味。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/en","Lyca knows the favorite food of every single one of her squadmates."],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","除了看星象，莱卡还会通过茶水中茶叶的浮沉判断一天的运势好坏。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/en","Aside from looking at the stars, Lyca also reads tea leaves to predict her luck for the day."],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","在翡湖学院就读期间，有同学向莱卡请教了比赛获胜的秘诀，莱卡的答复是：只参加有把握获胜的比赛。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/en","During her time at Jade Lake Academy, a classmate once asked Lyca for her secret to achieving victory. Her answer was that to only enter competitions where winning is assured."],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","莱卡毕业时，收到了许多同学的感谢信。每一封她都认真地回复了。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/en","During her graduation, Lyca received countless letters of gratitude from her classmates. She replied to every single one with the utmost care and thought. \"No matter what happens in the future, I will always remember our time together.\""],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","“曾经有个外来的流民说她是个看上去没什么本事的小姑娘，队长她……一箭把那个人的耳坠射断了。”一名新进巡游队队员心有余悸地说。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/en","\"An outsider once told her that she looked no different than a talentless girl. The next second... the captain shot off one of their earrings with a single arrow.\"—Testimony from a new and somewhat fearful patrol member."],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","嗯……这么多花草，哪些泡茶会好一点呢……"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/en","Hmm, so many herbs... What would make the best tea?"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415011.json"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415011.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Parisa"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","啊，是……是<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>…………您好，谢谢您的招待。"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/en","Oh, i-it's <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>... hello, and thank you for the hospitality."],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415026.json"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415026.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","伊温 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/en","Hewynn & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","嗯，蔬菜和草药你基本都认识，特殊的果实你也学过了……"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/en","Now, you've familiarized yourself with nearly all the vegetables, herbs, and special fruits..."],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415035.json"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415035.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 五月"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Lily May"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/cn","难得休息一会儿……"],["/interaction_records/3/preview_i18n/en","I can finally get some rest..."],["/interaction_records/3/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415114.json"],["/interaction_records/3/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415114.json"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/3/title_i18n/en","Lyca"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/cn","有什么新口味？"],["/interaction_records/4/preview_i18n/en","Any new flavors?"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415115.json"],["/interaction_records/4/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415115.json"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/4/title_i18n/en","Lyca"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/cn","隆冬节快到了，真怀念呀。"],["/interaction_records/5/preview_i18n/en","The Winter Carnival is almost here, and I can't help but feel a sense of excitement bubbling up."],["/interaction_records/5/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415343.json"],["/interaction_records/5/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415343.json"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/cn","塔西 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/5/title_i18n/en","Tasi & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/cn","看，这是雪灯树"],["/interaction_records/6/preview_i18n/en","Look, it's a Yuletide tree!"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415423.json"],["/interaction_records/6/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415423.json"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/6/title_i18n/en","Lyca"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/cn","我准备了很多礼物！"],["/interaction_records/7/preview_i18n/en","I've prepared lots of gifts!"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415424.json"],["/interaction_records/7/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415424.json"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/7/title_i18n/en","Lyca"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/cn","这儿真是个好地方，要是再来点音乐就更好了。"],["/interaction_records/8/preview_i18n/en","Wow, this place is great! It'd be even better with some music!"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415479.json"],["/interaction_records/8/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415479.json"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/8/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/cn","好漂亮的彩缎啊！"],["/interaction_records/9/preview_i18n/en","These satin ribbons are gorgeous."],["/interaction_records/9/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415597.json"],["/interaction_records/9/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415597.json"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/9/title_i18n/en","Lyca"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/cn","我准备了很漂亮的灯！"],["/interaction_records/10/preview_i18n/en","I've prepared the most splendid lights!"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415598.json"],["/interaction_records/10/locales/en","locales/en/mn/herohub_story/10415598.json"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/cn","莱卡"],["/interaction_records/10/title_i18n/en","Lyca"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/cn","没想到，我们好不容易再见面，却是在这样的情况下……"],["/interaction_records/11/preview_i18n/en","I didn't expect our reunion to happen in such circumstances..."],["/interaction_records/11/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412030.json"],["/interaction_records/11/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412030.json"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/cn","帕瑞莎 & 莱卡 & 卡夫拉"],["/interaction_records/11/title_i18n/en","Parisa & Lyca & Kafra"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/11/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/cn","好像有什么奇怪的声音，洛桑，你能听到吗？"],["/interaction_records/12/preview_i18n/en","Lorsan, do you hear that strange noise...?"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412070.json"],["/interaction_records/12/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412070.json"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 洛桑"],["/interaction_records/12/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Lorsan"],["/interaction_records/12/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/12/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/cn","莱卡，你今天准备的食物有点多吧？"],["/interaction_records/13/preview_i18n/en","Lyca, that's a lot of food you have prepared today."],["/interaction_records/13/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412100.json"],["/interaction_records/13/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412100.json"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/13/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我们三个真是难得聚在一起。"],["/interaction_records/14/preview_i18n/en","It's rare for the three of us to get together!"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412110.json"],["/interaction_records/14/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412110.json"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 埃隆 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/14/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Eironn & Parisa"],["/interaction_records/14/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/14/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/cn","无论看到多少次，卡夫拉这把大剑的威慑力还是很强……"],["/interaction_records/15/preview_i18n/en","No matter how many times I see it, Kafra's sword just looks intimidating..."],["/interaction_records/15/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10412170.json"],["/interaction_records/15/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10412170.json"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 卡夫拉 & 帕瑞莎"],["/interaction_records/15/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Kafra & Parisa"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","薄暮丛林"],["/interaction_records/15/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Dark Forest"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/cn","说起来，我还真怀念我上学的时候，最大的烦恼只是怎么学好功课而已。哪像现在……"],["/interaction_records/16/preview_i18n/en","Yeah, I really miss when I was in school. My biggest worry was my lessons, not like now..."],["/interaction_records/16/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413020.json"],["/interaction_records/16/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413020.json"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/cn","洛桑 & 芙拉贝尔 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/16/title_i18n/en","Lorsan & Florabelle & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/16/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/16/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/cn","我曾听过一句话，“星空中藏着每个人的命运”。"],["/interaction_records/17/preview_i18n/en","I once heard a saying, \"Everyone's destiny is hidden in the stars.\""],["/interaction_records/17/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413050.json"],["/interaction_records/17/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413050.json"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/17/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/17/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/17/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/cn","诸位，你们有没有觉得月影乡的人对外面有一些……奇怪的认知？"],["/interaction_records/18/preview_i18n/en","Don't you feel that the residents of Ivoryshade have some strange ideas about the outside world?"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413080.json"],["/interaction_records/18/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413080.json"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/cn","埃隆 & 莱卡"],["/interaction_records/18/title_i18n/en","Eironn & Lyca"],["/interaction_records/18/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/18/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/cn","这是纸鸢尾，这是绿黛兰……喏，漫漫你来闻闻，很香的。"],["/interaction_records/19/preview_i18n/en","This is an iris, and this is a green orchid... Here, Hammie, come. These smell very nice."],["/interaction_records/19/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn2/herohub_story/10413120.json"],["/interaction_records/19/locales/en","locales/en/mn2/herohub_story/10413120.json"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/cn","莱卡 & 漫漫 & 满满"],["/interaction_records/19/title_i18n/en","Lyca & Hammie & Chippy"],["/interaction_records/19/locations/0/name_i18n/cn","瓦度索山脉"],["/interaction_records/19/locations/0/name_i18n/en","Vaduso Mountains"]]}